 "prompt": "A close-up view of a cluttered but organized kitchen counter, ready for baking. A large stainless steel mixing bowl is in the center, with a wire whisk resting inside it. To the side, an open flour sack has a light dusting of flour around its base, and next to it is a carton of eggs and a glass bottle of milk. A set of measuring cups is stacked beside a wooden rolling pin. A clean baking sheet is ready on the counter. Various utensils are scattered about, including a wooden spoon, a spatula, and an oven mitt. A ceramic sugar bowl and a butter dish are placed near an open cookbook. A kitchen scale shows a reading, and a small mechanical timer is set. For seasoning, there's a salt shaker and a pepper grinder. In the background, a teapot sits next to a cup and a plate. A single yellow lemon adds a splash of color. This is a traditional baking setup, so it lacks some modern appliances; there is no microwave oven, no blender, and no electric coffee maker. The baker is focused, so their mobile phone is not on the counter, and there isn't a bunch of bananas anywhere.",
